# ── Burn Station configuration ───────────────────────────────────────────────

# Solana RPC endpoint — SERVER-SIDE ONLY. Deliberately has no VITE_ prefix so
# Vite never inlines it into client JS; the browser only ever talks to the
# same-origin /api/rpc proxy (api/rpc.ts), which forwards to this URL.
#
# For local dev: copy this file to `.env` and set it here (read by
# vite.config.ts's dev middleware, never by client code).
# For production: set it in Vercel -> Project Settings -> Environment
# Variables -> RPC_URL. Do NOT commit the real value to .env.
#
# The public endpoint is rate-limited and can't reliably list token accounts
# or serve NFT images. Use a free Helius key (https://helius.dev) or
# QuickNode/Alchemy/Triton — Helius also powers NFT images via its DAS API.
RPC_URL=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_HELIUS_KEY

# Platform fee in basis points. 100 = 1%. (Optional; defaults to 100.)
# Fine to keep VITE_-prefixed since it's just a percentage, not a secret.
VITE_FEE_BPS=100

# The fee-receiving wallet is no longer read from env — it's hardcoded in
# src/lib/config.ts (FEE_WALLET) since it's a public address, not a secret.
# Edit that constant directly if you need to change it.
